 <h3><u>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p dir=ltr>hala khanjar toh sarhane se pukari zehra</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Ay mere laal hussain (6)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chala khanjar toh sarhane se pukari zehra</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Teri gardan pe kiya karti thi mai pyaar kabhi<br> Apni tasveer ko karti thi tera haal kabhi<br> Kya qabar thi k chalegi yahin talwar kabhi<br> Isi gardan pe toh lete the payambar bosa</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Rehgaya khoon may reqabon ki tabeeron may<br> Aaj har simt se tu phir gaya shamsheeron may<br> Dekhun kin ankhon se laal tujhe teeron may<br> Kabhi jibreel jhulate the tera gehwara</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Aa mere laal mai anchal may chupalun tujhko<br> Maamta kehti hai bahon may basalun tujhko<br> Phir usi tarha mai seene se lagalun tujhko<br> Jaise ek baar mera bandhe kafan toota tha</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Tu hai woh phool k rota hai chaman bhi tujhko<br> Tu musafir hai k dhundega watan bhi tujhko<br> Haan magar denge na ashraar kafan bhi tujho<br> Woh bhi chin jayegi agar laash pe rakhdun mai rida</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Shimr ki ankhon may ghairat ki nishani bhi nahi<br> Doob hai itna k khanjar may rawani bhi nahi<br> Khush hai halq may rehal ka paani bhi nahi<br> Haan mere mahal may halan k yeh behta dariya</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Ab woh humshakle nabi akbar e jaraar kahan<br> Sogaya dast may abbas e alamdar kahan<br> Khaak e jungal may luti hai teri sarkar kahan<br> Kya ujadta hai bhala yun bhi kisika kumba</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Qasim o aun o mohammed ali akbar bhi nahi<br> Naaz tha jise pe tujhe ab toh woh lashkar bhi nahi<br> Kaanon baazu pe rakha hai k baradaar bhi nahi<br> Kya qabar thi k tu hojayega itna tanha</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Sab ko batlate hain ye log nabi ki ummat<br> Ab na ankhon may murawat na dilon may ghairat<br> Naam sa ghusl o kafan kaisi namaz e maiyyat<br> Chod jayenge ye sab khaak pe laasha tera</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Sogaye run may tere sog manane wale<br> Khoon may doob gaye khaak udane wale<br> Bekafan khud hai kafan tujhko pinane wale<br> Aa teri laash pe mai dalun woh ashkon ki rida</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Asr e ashoor ka hai ameer o nayyar woh asar<br> Ghumzade karbobala sa gaya har manzar par<br> Ab musalle pe ho mimbar pe hun ya bistar par<br> Ghum juda rehta hai socho mai wahi ek noha</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>Chakkiyan pees k ay laal tujhe pala tha(2)</p> 
